  "description": "继续看 Rust 文档，发现一个例子，说 Rust 的类型推导是有“反向推导”的。的确如此，这个例子里的数组没有标注成员的类型，然后根据后面的语句 push 进去的一个元素，反向“推导”出了整个数组就是 [u8] （8 位无符号整数）的类型。",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg\" width=\"1392\" height=\"1103\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1103,&quot;width&quot;:1392,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:187313,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xU5c!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F498ee4d7-52b7-4adc-99d3-048af6eade4a_1392x1103.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>继续看 Rust 文档，发现<a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/rust-by-example/types/inference.html\">一个例子</a>，说 Rust 的类型推导是有“反向推导”的。的确如此，这个例子里的数组没有标注成员的类型，然后根据后面的语句 push 进去的一个元素，反向“推导”出了整个数组就是 [u8] （8 位无符号整数）的类型。</p><p>下面的文字说，不用写类型，编译器和程序员都高兴。No type annotation of variables was needed, the compiler is happy and so is the programmer!</p><p>真的如此吗？其实这里不写数组的类型，阅读的时候你就得每次都去想这个数组里是什么类型。要等到你看到下面那个 push，还得再跳回去看一下 elem 是什么类型，才能知道数组里面都是 u8 类型。这就是在做“人脑类型推导”。而且你不止要做一次…</p>",
  "truncated_body_text": "继续看 Rust 文档，发现一个例子，说 Rust 的类型推导是有“反向推导”的。的确如此，这个例子里的数组没有标注成员的类型，然后根据后面的语句 push 进去的一个元素，反向“推导”出了整个数组就是 [u8] （8 位无符号整数）的类型。",
